 "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13930486/state.json" "file_sha256" "9186a80455cc68616a01432300a59c7e5bf3759d89dd60e1f6e0e48abb1eb896" "basis" 320 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13930486/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74716" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "4.73"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13930486/state.json" "file_sha256" "9186a80455cc68616a01432300a59c7e5bf3759d89dd60e1f6e0e48abb1eb896" "basis" 320 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13930486/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-74716" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "4.07"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13930486/state.json" "file_sha256" "9186a80455cc68616a01432300a59c7e5bf3759d89dd60e1f6e0e48abb1eb896" "basis" 320 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13930486/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-170494" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find, in radians to two decimal places, the argument of $z=9-6\\text{i}.$ \n\n**Hint**: The argument of a complex number is in the range $[0,2\\pi ).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13930486/state.json" "file_sha256" "9186a80455cc68616a01432300a59c7e5bf3759d89dd60e1f6e0e48abb1eb896" "basis" 320 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13930486/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-170494" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's plot $z$ in the complex plane.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13930486/assets/1bc5f38d44d9df32a7493f8d210bbc17d716d8a63316e3d730a1c4258d56fe46.png)\n\nThe complex number $z$ lies in the fourth quadrant of the complex plane. Therefore $\\frac{3\\pi }{2}<arg⁡(z)<2\\pi .$ \n\nIf $\\alpha $ is the angle that $z$ makes with the positive real axis, then\n\n$$\n\\alpha =arctan⁡(\\frac{6}{9})=arctan⁡(\\frac{2}{3})≈0.588\\,00.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\theta =arg⁡(z)=2\\pi -0.588\\,00≈5.70\n$$\n\nto two decimal places." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13930486/state.json" "file_sha256" "9186a80455cc68616a01432300a59c7e5bf3759d89dd60e1f6e0e48abb1eb896" "basis" 320 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13930486/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-170494" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13930486/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "59830984d11c84f433473922c52bfca2dd9f8745ba91fa00a054f7687658f69a" "basis" 320 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13930486/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-170494" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13930486/state.json" "file_sha256" "9186a80455cc68616a01432300a59c7e5bf3759d89dd60e1f6e0e48abb1eb896" "basis" 320 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13930486/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-170494" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "4.84"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question